,"locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"mcampo84","id":1612096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTIwOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1612096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84","html_url":"https://github.com/mcampo84","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-01-08T15:02:25Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T15:12:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"mcampo84","id":1612096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTIwOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1612096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84","html_url":"https://github.com/mcampo84","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcampo84/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Description\n\nJob Manager is a module responsible for the following operations on a Job:\n* `start`\n* `stop`\n* `status`\n* `stream`\n\n## Start\n`start` will do the following:\n* Parameters:\n  * `command` the command to be executed\n  * `args` a variadic list of arguments to be applied to the command\n* Start the process, passing args as they've been provided. \n* Assign the process to a `cgroup`\n* Open an output buffer and send all output lines to that buffer, to be accessed later through the `stream` command.\n* Return the PID of the job, or an error if an error is returned from the OS.\n\n## Stop\n`stop` will do the following:\n* Parameters:\n  * `pid` the process ID\n* Halt the process\n* Close the output buffer\n* Remove the PID from the `cgroup`\n* Return an error, if one is encountered\n\n## Status\n`status` will do the following:\n* Parameters:\n  * `pid` the process ID\n* Query the OS for process utilization metrics:\n  * CPU utilization\n  * Memory usage\n  * Disk I/O bandwidth\n* Return the metrics, or an error if one has been encountered\n\n## Stream\n`stream` will do the following:\n* Parameters:\n  * `pid` the process ID\n* Return the io buffer stream of the job or an error if one has been encountered","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcampo84/teleport_challenge/issues/3/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcampo84/teleport_challenge/issues/3/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcampo84/teleport_challenge/issues/2","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcam